===================================================
    
Case 1: NUMERIC and MONETARY - a correlated subquery keyed by one value of two scales or currencies returns the uncached results     

===================================================
ca    (select d.cb||'' from db_root)    
221     1.0     
222     1.00     

===================================================
result    
PASS     

===================================================
ca    (select d.cb||'' from db_root)    
231     $1     
232     \1     

===================================================
result    
PASS     

===================================================
    
Case 2: DOUBLE, FLOAT and MONETARY - a correlated subquery keyed by -0 and 0, or by -NaN and NaN, returns the uncached results     

===================================================
ca    (select d.cb||'' from db_root)    
241     0     
242     -0     

===================================================
result    
PASS     

===================================================
ca    (select d.cb||'' from db_root)    
251     0     
252     -0     

===================================================
result    
PASS     

===================================================
ca    (select d.cb||'' from db_root)    
271     NaN     
272     -NaN     

===================================================
result    
PASS     

===================================================
ca    (select d.cb||'' from db_root)    
261     $0     
262     $-0     

===================================================
result    
PASS     

